# Machine-local UE engine override - copy to ue_path.local.conf.
# ue_path.local.conf is gitignored; its keys override ue_path.conf PER KEY.
#
# STRICT GRAMMAR (same as ue_path.conf - see its header for the full
# contract): KEY=VALUE, no spaces around '=', no quotes, no '$', no
# inline comments; duplicate/unknown/empty keys are errors.
#
# Known keys: UE_PATH, UE_SOURCE_PATH, LINUX_MULTIARCH_ROOT, BUILD_TARGET,
#             BUILD_CONFIG, BUILD_PLATFORM
#
# You may declare any SUBSET - e.g. only UE_PATH to point this machine
# at a different launcher install:
# UE_PATH=D:/Engines/CustomInstall
# LINUX_MULTIARCH_ROOT=C:/UnrealToolchains/v26_clang-20.1.8-rockylinux8
#
# Engine VERSION updates: never edit paths by hand - run
#   scripts/ue/update/update_engine.ps1
# (it updates ue_path.local.conf too when present).
